# AI RAG Quality Guardrails

- Separate diagnosis into stages before changing prompts:
  1) extraction/indexing
  2) retrieval mode/hit quality
  3) prompt assembly
  4) provider/runtime behavior
- Preserve dual retrieval support:
  - Qdrant-enabled path
  - JSON fallback path
- Prompt changes are behavioral changes; require evaluation evidence.
- Reject fabricated citations and unsupported claims.
- Keep receipt extraction safety intact (`NOT_RECEIPT`, validation failures).

Reference: `docs/EVALUATION.md`, `docs/PROMPTS.md`, `docs/RAG_SETUP.md`
